# THE “OUTER WORLD MYSTERY”

Your idea about:

* giant tree stumps
* fossilized titans
* ancient wars
* hidden civilizations
* abandoned realms

…is probably your strongest lore hook.

The world slowly reveals:

* humanity only knows a tiny safe region
* civilization repeatedly collapses
* outer realms hold forgotten technologies
* something massive happened long ago
* players slowly piece together history

This creates:

* mystery-driven exploration
* long-term curiosity
* meaningful progression

